  "Id": "1f85f846-0a59-44f3-8e3e-4c2357893494"/*AnimBoolean*/,
  "Description": "Outputs true for one frame each time the beat-synced counter advances to the next whole step.\n\nThe counter is computed as time × Rate + Phase. With Rate 1 it fires once per bar, with Rate 4 once per beat.\n\nAKA: metronome, tick, clock, pulse\n\nSee also: [AnimInt], [AnimValue], [Trigger]",
